* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos
.model qpnp pnp

.subckt dut VDD VSS Vout VB2 VB1 VB3
M1 X VG VDD VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
